{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"<@&636744896287342602> as a player the portent mechanic particularly (and to lesser extent the the luck mechanic) have not worked well on discord in groups larger than about 4-5 players. I have some ideas about how it may be improved for next time or maybe just nix it as an option. It's extremely rare for me to \"tilt\" as a player but the rulings and such around this has tested that. To be clear I am not blaming the DMs I think it is an aspect of confusion and pace that occurs with the larger encounters  Edit following: (due to numbers of players and all the necessary juggling).","created_at":"2020-08-22T06:34:03.922000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-22T06:40:00.549000Z","id":"746618172932751381","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
